# Pairs with NoRelay. The shipper's local-origin cycle-break is removed: b
# ships the writes it applied from a onward to c, so a -> b -> c becomes a
# path and every apply is re-shipped.
MODULE: NoRelayShipsForeignWrites
TARGET: NoRelay
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: drops the shipper's local-origin cycle-break, so a cluster relays the writes it applied from a peer
PERTURBS: Deliver

--- FIND
       /\ \/ ShouldShip(s, w)
          \/ w.o = x
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: any entry of the source's WAL is shipped.
       /\ TRUE
--- END
